==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~20 seconds<sup>30f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~20 seconds<sup>30f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When Those Guys come near the [[Cat Base]], keep spawning meatshields and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]]. Meanwhile, upgrade your Worker Cat until it reaches max level. When the Baa Baas appear, you should have enough money to spawn all of your cats at once. But mostly, use your meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]], and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]].
*Note: By this point, you should have the [[Energy Drink]] unlocked, and the "Worker Cat Wallet" ability in the [[Upgrade Menu]] should be upgraded. (You don't absolutely need it, but it will make the level easier to beat.)

