==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Osaka Prefecture'''.
*Osaka Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Tsūtenkaku|Tsūtenkaku]], a tower built in Osaka in 1912 and modeled after the Eiffel Tower. The two objects behind the base are [[wikipedia:Takoyaki|''takoyaki'']], one of Osaka's most iconic dishes.

